      "writtenOn": "2023-04-05T07:02:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If I read the code correctly, we don\u0027t do this check when adding addresses to LinkProperties for \"normal upstream\" networks:\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/NetworkStack/src/android/net/ip/IpClientLinkObserver.java;drc\u003dd63e15d8506937a7e85fdff8f9d578ee444e71b9;l\u003d633\n\nAnd then we use all addresses from LinkProperties in handleLinkPropertiesChanged. So either something is missing there, or this check isn\u0027t necessary here ?",
      "revId": "6ee4442e9891201186514a0912b325656c7d12bf",
